{"review_id": "14344435230", "app_id": "1518956326", "app_name": "MyRoutine: Organize your day", "country": "tw", "country_name": "Taiwan", "rating": 1, "title": "付費機制很奇怪", "body": "我點選了590的年優惠，結果出現的付費資訊有年優惠590，還有7天試用後的790，優惠費用590不是就是pro訂閱的790嗎？怎麼一個訂閱價有兩筆？", "author": "Rosa lin vv", "date": "2026-07-25T00:23:01Z", "vote_count": 0, "vote_sum": 0, "is_edited": false}
{"review_id": "14341166322", "app_id": "1518956326", "app_name": "MyRoutine: Organize your day", "country": "tw", "country_name": "Taiwan", "rating": 1, "title": "還沒試用先被收錢", "body": "才剛下載還沒開始用就先被收590，還要花時間找怎麼退費\n想用的心都沒了\n本來感覺是很棒的app", "author": "WTFOxoooxx", "date": "2026-07-24T05:12:12Z", "vote_count": 0, "vote_sum": 0, "is_edited": false}
{"review_id": "14330429695", "app_id": "1518956326", "app_name": "MyRoutine: Organize your day", "country": "tw", "country_name": "Taiwan", "rating": 1, "title": "狀況需要排除‼️", "body": "我買了終身會員，每新增一個新內容它都不會自動跳出來，還要我整個刪掉頁面重新開一次app才有新增，這造成我很大的麻煩困擾，麻煩請盡快改進更新😭", "author": "zsdiidi", "date": "2026-07-21T13:53:01Z", "vote_count": 0, "vote_sum": 0, "is_edited": false}
